== Trivia ==
* "Pupula Duplex" is said to be a condition in which a person has two irises and two pupils in one eye, without any actual recorded cases. An actual rare medical condition similar to it exists, called [[wikipedia:Polycoria|polycoria]].
* This item's appearance is similar to {{I|Diplopia}}.

